<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <script src="https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Georgia:wght@400;700&amp;family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #fff;
            color: #000;
            line-height: 1.4;
            font-size: 12pt;
        }

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .column {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .left-col, .right-col {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .center-col {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 150px;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 15px 0;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
        }

        .text-block {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        ul, ol {
            margin-left: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        strong {
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Sample Document Layout</h1>

<div class="column">
    <!-- Left Column -->
    <div class="left-col">
        <p class="text-block"><strong>Header Text</strong><br>
        Body text starting here. This is the first column.</p>

        <p class="text-block">Second paragraph in column one. Notice the indentation if present.</p>

        <div class="placeholder">[Chart: left side, 150px tall]</div>

        <ul>
            <li>List item 1</li>
            <li>List item 2</li>
            <li>List item 3</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column -->
    <div class="right-col">
        <p class="text-block"><em>Right column text</em> – appears side-by-side in the original layout.</p>

        <p class="text-block">Another paragraph here.</p>

        <div class="placeholder">[Image: right side, 100px wide]</div>

        <p><strong>Bold text</strong> and <em>italic text</em> mixed.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="center-col">
    <div class="placeholder">[Diagram: full width, centered]</div>

    <p class="text-block" style="text-align: center; font-size: 11pt;">
        Centered text block for emphasis.
    </p>
</div>

<!-- Bottom section -->
<p class="text-block" style="text-align: right;">
    Right-aligned text example.
</p>

<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0;">
    <tr>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px;">Cell 1</td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px;">Cell 2</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px; colspan="2">Merged cell example</td>
    </tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
```
